Local derivative provenance
---------------------------

The RC2026_Map_Planner tree was derived in 2026 from:

    https://github.com/byangw/PCT_planner.git
    baseline commit 35cd73fd82bcd51bc538429294af7646b2a09815

Local changes include ROS 2 Humble runtime integration, configurable
navigation parameters, PCD/tomogram conversion and transport tools, map and
goal visualization, a ROS 2 navigation wrapper, aarch64 build corrections,
planner/smoother portability fixes, exact BSD-3-Clause metadata for the bundled
GTSAM package, and regression tests. Runtime maps,
tomograms, recordings, handoff manifests, generated extension modules, and
build/install directories are data or generated artifacts and are not part of
the public corresponding source. See PROVENANCE.md and the offline verification
script for the auditable, byte-level dependency comparison.